    {
      "title": "⚔️ Queen's Domain, the two-person King's Field-style hit, keeps rolling",
      "tags": [
        "PS5",
        "Switch 2",
        "Xbox",
        "PC",
        "RPG"
      ],
      "body": "Freshly Baked Games' retro-fantasy action RPG sold 100,000 copies in under five days and has reportedly already recouped its costs. Its first proper update adds the Grave Knife throwing weapon, a screen-shake toggle, clearer status effects and tweaks to make some late puzzles less frustrating. Console fix patches have been rolling out, with the Switch 2 updates due early this week. It's $19.99, and there's a free demo on Steam.",
